Package: com.samcejko.kodium
Name: Kodium
Version: 0.1.0-3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: A code editor for jailbroken iOS 6: the VS Code workbench
 Kodium puts the workbench of the open-source VS Code, assembled through
 monaco-vscode-api, on iOS 6 devices: files, editor tabs, syntax
 highlighting, search, the command palette, settings and keybindings. It runs
 on the device itself, on the engine of the Surfari browser: its own TLS 1.2
 connections, and modern CSS and JavaScript rewritten for the iOS 6 WebKit.
 Made for iOS 6.x on armv7 devices such as the iPad 2. An early version.
Maintainer: samcejko
Author: samcejko
Homepage: https://github.com/samcejko/kodium-ios6
Section: Productivity
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 7.0), com.samcejko.kodium-shell
Icon: file:///Applications/Kodium.app/Icon.png
